+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>Kan · Evidence Library</title><script src="/theme.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/base.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><script src="/app.js" defer></script></head><body><div class="shell"><aside><a class="brand" href="/">kan<span>•</span></a><div class="workspace">YOUR KNOWLEDGE</div><div class="nav" aria-current="page">Evidence Library</div><p class="aside-note">Retained source.<br>Inspectable provenance.</p><details><summary>Build coverage</summary><p>Live inventory and source inspection. Session reconstruction, search, annotations, saved views, analysis and admin jobs are upcoming.</p></details><span class="local">Authorized reader</span></aside><main><header><div><div class="eyebrow">KAN STUDIO / LIBRARY</div><h1>Your evidence library.</h1><p class="subtitle">Explore retained occurrences and inspect the bytes behind them.</p></div><div class="header-actions"><label for="theme">Appearance</label><select id="theme"><option value="system">System</option><option value="light">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select><button id="lock" disabled>Lock</button></div></header><section id="login" class="panel login"><div><h2>Open your Library</h2><p>This reader has its own scope grants. Your access token stays in this tab’s memory.</p></div><form id="connect"><label for="token">Reader access token</label><div class="login-fields"><input id="token" type="password" autocomplete="off" required><button class="primary">Open Library</button></div></form></section><div id="notice" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Locked · connect to browse authorized evidence.</div><section id="library" hidden><div class="toolbar"><label for="scope">Authorized scope</label><select id="scope"></select><button id="resnapshot">Refresh snapshot</button><span id="coverage"></span></div><div class="browser"><section class="panel occurrences" aria-label="Retained occurrences"><div class="section-head"><h2>Occurrences</h2><span id="count" class="badge"></span></div><p>Committed entries at the selected snapshot.</p><div id="rows"></div><p id="empty" hidden>No occurrences in this scope at this snapshot.</p><div class="pagination"><button id="previous" disabled>Previous</button><span id="page-position"></span><button id="next" disabled>Next</button></div></section><section class="panel inspector" aria-label="Source inspector"><div class="section-head"><h2 id="selection">Select an occurrence</h2><button id="close-inspector" hidden>Close</button></div><p id="source-hint">Read exact retained bytes alongside their provenance.</p><div id="inspection" hidden><div class="tabs"><button id="source-tab" aria-pressed="true">Source</button><button id="provenance-tab" aria-pressed="false">Provenance</button></div><div id="source-panel"><div class="range"><span id="range"></span><button id="encoding">Show hex</button><button id="download">Download this range</button><button id="more" disabled>Next range</button></div><pre id="source" tabindex="0"></pre></div><dl id="provenance" hidden></dl></div></section></div></section></main></div></body></html>
